{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CH","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"歷代志下","commonName":"歷代志下","title":"歷代志下","order":14,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"f440330757d9f7150b4f1ee6f00c3941c1130aecd7b039c9cd6c1d71a8c2f5d6","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":818},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["聖殿的器具"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["所羅門造了一座銅壇，長九米，寬九米，高四米半。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他又鑄了一個圓形銅海，高兩米二，直徑四米半，周長十三米半。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["銅海邊緣下面有兩圈牛的圖案，每四十五釐米有十頭牛，是跟銅海一起鑄造的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["有十二頭銅牛馱著銅海，三頭向北，三頭向西，三頭向南，三頭向東。銅海安在牛上，牛尾向內。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["銅海厚八釐米，邊如杯邊，又如百合花，容量為六萬六千升。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他又造了十個盆，五個放右邊，五個放左邊，用來清洗獻燔祭所用之物。但銅海只供祭司洗滌使用。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他照著所定的式樣，造了十個金燈臺放在殿裡，五個在右邊，五個在左邊；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["又造了十張桌子放在殿裡，五張在右邊，五張在左邊；還造了一百個金碗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他又建了祭司院、大院及大院的門，門都包上銅。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["銅海放在殿的右邊，就是東南方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["戶蘭又造了鍋、鏟和碗。他為所羅門王完成了上帝殿裡的工作。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["戶蘭所製造的有：兩根柱子，兩個碗狀的柱冠，兩個裝飾柱冠的網子，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["四百個安在網子上的石榴，每個網子上兩行石榴，用來裝飾碗狀的柱冠；"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["盆座及盆座上的盆；"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["銅海和銅海下面的十二頭銅牛；"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["鍋、鏟、肉叉及耶和華殿裡的一切器具。這些都是巧匠戶蘭用磨亮的銅為所羅門王製造的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["這些都是照王的命令，在疏割和撒利但之間的約旦平原用泥模鑄成的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["所羅門製造的器具極多，銅的重量無法統計。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["所羅門又為上帝的殿造了以下器具：金壇和放供餅的桌子，"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["按規定放在內殿前的純金燈臺和燈盞，"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["燈臺上的金花、燈盞、火鉗、"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["燈剪、碗、碟和火鼎。殿門和至聖所的門也是金的。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}